+
+**Deliverables (branch `physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-block35-gravity-kernel-under-the-formation-reading-heat-kernel-times-plane-green-function-20260918`, independent PR against `main` at `9a3ffc8d91`; parent on `main`: block 01):** the note `docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_GRAVITY_NODE_KERNEL_UNDER_THE_FORMATION_READING_A_HEAT_KERNEL_IN_LEVEL_TIME_TIMES_A_PLANE_GREEN_FUNCTION_NOT_THE_COMPARATORS_THREE_DIMENSIONAL_GREEN_FUNCTION_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-18.md`; the runner `scripts/admissibility_rule_gravity_node_kernel_under_the_formation_reading_heat_kernel_in_level_time_times_plane_green_function_2026_09_18.py` (15 checks, 7 mutations, exact, one second); the pinned cache; the control (`specs/supervisor_control_block35_kernel_sim.py`) and the refuting pass (`..._refuter.py`) with outputs; `GOAL_block35.md`; `CHECKER_block35_findings.md`; this record; `CLAIM_STATUS_CERTIFICATE_block35.md`; appends to the shared records.
+
+**Result.**
+- T1 (proved): `Cov(θ̂_k(t), θ̂_k(t+s)) = σ²φ(k)^s(1 − u^t)/(1 − u)`; stationary kernel `C_s = σ²(I − PP*)^{−1}P*^s` on the nonzero modes — a plane Green function times the level-time heat kernel; the zero mode random-walks; checked by exact rational cross-level recursions on `L = 3, 4` against `Re φ^s` for every cosine character.
+- T2 (proved): `1 − u = kᵀMk + O(k⁴)`, `M = (1/9)[[2,−1],[−1,2]]`, eigenvalues `1/9` along `(1,1)`, `1/3` along `(1,−1)`; symmetry group of order six (the three predecessor directions); the comparator's `E = |k|² + O(k⁴)` with the 48 signed permutations.
+- T3 (proved): `|C_s|/C_0 = |φ|^s ≤ e^{−2|k|²s/(9π²)}` — diffusive, `r² ~ s`; drift `φ = 1 + i(k₁ + k₂)/3 + …` along the cone's axis; the comparator's `1/E` is not a product of a plane factor and a propagator in any direction (`∂²log E/∂k₁∂k₃ ≠ 0`).
+- Executed (not claimed): on a `256 × 256` plane the nonlinear law's equal-level structure factor is the linearized kernel times `0.83–0.89` (`β = 6`), `0.90–0.94` (`12`), `0.94–0.97` (`24`), rising with `|k|` and `β`; the cross-level ratios reproduce `φ(k)^s` in modulus and phase to a few percent up to `s = 64`; the structure function `E|θ_x − θ_{x+r}|²` is the linear one times a ratio falling from `0.88, 0.94, 0.97` at `r = 1` to `0.84, 0.89, 0.93` at `r = 32`.
+
+**What this changes.** The gravity lane's kernel is a comparator object; under the axiom's reading the same channel is a diffusive, anisotropic, level-time kernel with no three-dimensional potential in it. What the gravity node's construction gives with this input is the gravity lane's obligation.
